Package: kitpro-server
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: KITPro Project <joshlacy@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: adduser, apparmor, systemd
Homepage: https://github.com/KITProHQ/kitpro
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: local application manager for KITPro Server
 KITPro Server provides an authenticated local dashboard and a confined
 privileged helper for installing and managing approved self-hosted
 applications through Docker Engine. Docker Engine is an external runtime
 prerequisite and is not installed by this package.
